{"availability":"available","full":"Mapika/decider","name":"decider","description":"A family of System One-style models fine-tuned from Qwen3.5, designed for one-pass typed decisions with calibrated probabilities.","category":"Design","language":"Python","stars":1157,"forks":51,"created":"2026-09-16T07:15:09Z","updated":"2026-10-12T10:04:47Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":[],"demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/hugging-apps/decider-2b-vision-demo","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T02:58:01.836Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T02:58:01.836Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T02:58:01.836Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T04:29:20.467Z","stars":1124,"forks":48},{"at":"2026-10-17T02:58:01.836Z","stars":1157,"forks":51}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A language model that does not generate text. It reads a state and a set of typed questions and returns, from one forward pass, a probability distribution for every question.","A typed decision is a question with a fixed answer set: Choice over 2 to 255 options, Score over 2 to 10 described levels, or Noul, the probability of yes. There is no decoding, no parsing, and no output outside the options you defined.","The typed form (systemone), the HTTP server and GGUF loading are in Quick start."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Mapika/decider/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"4dabdac527ef139a92e52545225cff936835fb408b8f5fa841f8bbd7f8d15e02","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T04:29:20.604Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T04:29:20.604Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A language model that does not generate text. It reads a state and a set of typed questions and returns, from one forward pass, a probability distribution for every question.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Mapika/decider/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"4dabdac527ef139a92e52545225cff936835fb408b8f5